  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n5x2 + 7x + 5 = 0\n\n**Calculations:**\n\nAccording to question,\n\n5x2 + 7x + 5 = 0\n\n⇒5x² + 5 = - 7x\n\n⇒5x(x + 1/x) = - 7x\n\n⇒x + 1/x = -7/5\n\nso, x³ + 1/x³\n\n= (-7/5)³ - 3 × (-7/5)\n\n= - 343/125 + 21/5\n\n= (-343 + 525 )/125\n\n= 182/125\n\n**Hence, The Required value is 182/125.**",
